# Attribution

Commits: `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*` = Murray only. Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`.

PRs: body must not contain `Made with Cursor` or `Made-with: Cursor`. After `gh pr create`, immediately:

1. Read `gh pr view N --json body`
2. Strip those lines
3. `gh pr edit N --body-file` with the cleaned text
4. Confirm the body is clean before pasting the URL

Do not rewrite already-merged history to strip old footers.
